    "location": "html-block:71",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "MiCOM P211"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:72",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:73",
    "text": "The MiCOM P211 relay is designed for motor supervision, protection and control applications.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "Designed to offer a wide range of functions related to motor protection, supervision and control, the MiCOM P211’s flexibility makes it appropriate for use in medium or low-voltage applications.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Easily adaptable and equipped with MODBUS RTU protocol",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "Appropriate for use in both MV and LV applications, MiCOM P211 can be easily adapted to different applications and operational conditions. MiCOM S1 setting software facilitates even more by enabling easy configuration and access to all measurements.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "MODBUS RTU protocol allows interfacing with substation control and SCADA systems. The relay is housed in a small case for rail or flush mounting.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "A cost-efficient, flexible solution",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "Equipped with a range of quality features at a competitive price, the MiCOM P211 provides an efficient and flexible motor protection relay.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "Contractual warranty",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "Period : 2 years",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
